cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  agent-evidence-matrix: outside agent-evidence formats read against their own specifications
message: >-
  Cite the commit you read: each cell is a reading of one pinned revision of a specification and its code.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gilda
    given-names: Sankalp
    email: sankalp.gilda@gmail.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3645-4501'
repository-code: https://github.com/probityai/agent-evidence-matrix
abstract: >-
  A matrix of outside agent-evidence formats, each read against the text of its own specification and its own test kit at a pinned revision, with the adapter, the run and the replay command for every cell.
keywords:
  - conformance testing
  - agent evidence
  - interoperability
  - Internet-Drafts
  - agentic systems
